      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315009
    m_Localized: CONTINUE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315010
    m_Localized: Collect. Escape. Don't be seen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315011
    m_Localized: CONTINUE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315012
    m_Localized: START GAME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315013
    m_Localized: CONTROLS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315014
    m_Localized: SETTINGS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315015
    m_Localized: EXIT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315016
    m_Localized: START OVER?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315017
    m_Localized: Your saved run (floor {floor}) will be lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 22165078315018
    m_Localized: START OVER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315019
    m_Localized: HOW TO PLAY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315020
    m_Localized: <b>1.</b>   Collect every star hidden in the maze.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315021
    m_Localized: <b>2.</b>   A hatch will open somewhere. Find it before the timer runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315022
    m_Localized: <b>3.</b>   You are not alone down here. If it sees you, <color=#DB1F17><b>run</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315023
    m_Localized: <b>4.</b>   Shards glint in the dark. Between floors, someone will sell you things for them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315024
    m_Localized: START
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1867415029280768
    m_Localized: MOUSE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315026
    m_Localized: '<b>LEFT THUMB</b>  move   <b>RIGHT THUMB</b>  look   buttons: <b>TORCH</b>, <b>FOCUS</b>, <b>INTERACT</b>, <b>THROW</b>, <b>SPRINT</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315027
    m_Localized: "Your torch has three minutes of light in it. Your legs have less. Lockers hide you \u2014 unless it saw you climb in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315028
    m_Localized: PAUSED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315029
    m_Localized: RESUME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315030
    m_Localized: RESTART MAZE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315031
    m_Localized: SKIP TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315032
    m_Localized: MAIN MENU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315033
    m_Localized: QUIT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315034
    m_Localized: "READMITTED  \xB7  ADMISSION {admission}  \xB7  PATIENT {patient}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 22165078315035
    m_Localized: THE CLERK HAS TYPED YOUR RETURN.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315036
    m_Localized: The hatch closed behind you. Someone has left a light on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315037
    m_Localized: already yours
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315038
    m_Localized: no pay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315039
    m_Localized: PAYOUT  +{amount}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 22165078315040
    m_Localized: '{currency}  {shards}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 22165078315041
    m_Localized: "EFFECTS HELD AT THE SHOP  \xB7  {shards} {currency}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 22165078315042
    m_Localized: CONTRACT  {name}  DONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 22165078315043
    m_Localized: CONTRACT  {name}  FAILED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 22165078315044
    m_Localized: CONTRACT  {name}  VOID
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 22165078315045
    m_Localized: YOU GOT OUT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315046
    m_Localized: FLOOR {floor} CLEARED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 22165078315047
    m_Localized: The hatch closed behind you. There is nothing left below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315048
    m_Localized: The hatch closed behind you. Somehow, the way down leads back up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315049
    m_Localized: IT FOUND YOU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315050
    m_Localized: It watched you hide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315051
    m_Localized: It was faster in the dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315052
    m_Localized: You never heard it coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315053
    m_Localized: OUT OF TIME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22165078315054
    m_Localized: The hatch sealed. You were {stars} {stars:plural:star|stars} in and {metres} {metres:plural:metre|metres} away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 22165078315055
    m_Localized: FLOOR {floor}     STARS {collected} / {total}     TIME {time}     SEED {seed}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
