  - m_Id: 1857900695252992
    m_Localized: PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1857900695252993
    m_Localized: This game contains flickering lights, sudden darkness and patterns that may trigger seizures in people with photosensitive epilepsy. If you or anyone in your family has had a seizure, consult a doctor before playing. Stop immediately if you feel dizzy, have blurred vision, eye or muscle twitches, or disorientation. You can turn on REDUCE FLASHING here or in SETTINGS > GENERAL at any time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1857900695252994
    m_Localized: SAVE NOT LOADED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1857900695252995
    m_Localized: Your saved run was made by a newer version of the game. It has been kept aside, not deleted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1857900695252996
    m_Localized: Your saved run could not be read and has been set aside. A new campaign will start fresh.
    m_Metadata:
