  - m_Id: 1883058210336768
    m_Localized: MICROPHONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834240
    m_Localized: MICROPHONE DEVICE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834241
    m_Localized: NO MICROPHONE FOUND
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834242
    m_Localized: HEARD ABOVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834243
    m_Localized: YOUR LEVEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834244
    m_Localized: OFF
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834245
    m_Localized: LISTENING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834246
    m_Localized: NO SIGNAL - CHECK MIC PRIVACY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834247
    m_Localized: NO DEVICE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834248
    m_Localized: Used only while you play, to let the hunter hear you. Nothing is recorded, saved or sent. Headphones recommended.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834249
    m_Localized: It found you in the dark, away from your light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834250
    m_Localized: CAM {n}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 1883058285834251
    m_Localized: REC
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834252
    m_Localized: IT CAME FOR YOU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834253
    m_Localized: IT WAS BEHIND YOU THE WHOLE TIME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834254
    m_Localized: VOICE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1883058285834255
    m_Localized: IT HEARS YOU FROM FURTHER AWAY, EVEN IN A LOCKER.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1888333877211136
    m_Localized: It followed you up. There is no safe room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1888333877211137
    m_Localized: "THE ASYLUM \xB7 FLOOR {floor}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 1896792261652480
    m_Localized: RECORD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652481
    m_Localized: NEW ADMISSION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652482
    m_Localized: BEGIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652483
    m_Localized: ASSISTS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652484
    m_Localized: ADMISSION KIT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652485
    m_Localized: KIT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652486
    m_Localized: STARTING TORCH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652487
    m_Localized: The beam colour you start with. Earned colours are never sold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652488
    m_Localized: ASSISTED CAMPAIGNS STILL UNLOCK THINGS, BUT SET NO RECORDS OR OATHS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652489
    m_Localized: OATHS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652490
    m_Localized: OATHS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652491
    m_Localized: DONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652492
    m_Localized: Stackable vows. Every Oath makes the asylum harder and pays more shards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652493
    m_Localized: NEEDS A CAMPAIGN WITHOUT ASSISTS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652494
    m_Localized: "OATH {rank}  \xB7  SHARDS \xD7{mult}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331669776663334
  - m_Id: 1896792261652495
    m_Localized: STANDARD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652496
    m_Localized: The game as it was made.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652497
    m_Localized: STORY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652498
    m_Localized: Longer countdowns, a gentler torch, a slower hunter, honest cues, brighter halls. Everything still unlocks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652499
    m_Localized: NIGHTMARE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652500
    m_Localized: "Shorter countdowns, a keener hunter, a hungrier torch. Shards \xD71.25 and Oath rank +2."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652501
    m_Localized: LONGER COUNTDOWN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652502
    m_Localized: The escape countdown lasts half as long again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652503
    m_Localized: GENTLE TORCH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652504
    m_Localized: The battery drains slower and recharges faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652505
    m_Localized: SLOWER HUNTER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652506
    m_Localized: It takes longer to commit to a chase, runs slower and hears less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652507
    m_Localized: HONEST CUES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652508
    m_Localized: No lying sounds, no false phantoms, no torch failures, and the hunter's eyes always show.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652509
    m_Localized: BRIGHTER HALLS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652510
    m_Localized: More ambient light, thinner fog, stronger lamps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652511
    m_Localized: STEADY TORCH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652512
    m_Localized: The torch no longer sways or lags behind the view. Does not affect records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652513
    m_Localized: NO DEATH REPLAY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652514
    m_Localized: The end screen skips the grainy replay of the hunter catching you. Does not affect records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652515
    m_Localized: OLD BATTERY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652516
    m_Localized: The torch starts every floor half charged and recharges slowly, floor 1 included.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652517
    m_Localized: IT DOES NOT WAIT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652518
    m_Localized: From floor 1 the hunter keeps pace with a walker, commits sooner and its eyes are dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652519
    m_Localized: WELDED LOCKERS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652520
    m_Localized: Every locker in the mazes is welded shut. Nowhere to hide, and the hunter never checks them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652521
    m_Localized: STAN WAKES EARLY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652522
    m_Localized: Stan walks from floor 2 instead of floor 4.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652523
    m_Localized: NO SECOND CHANCES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652524
    m_Localized: 'No Second Wind anywhere, and the first catch on a floor is no longer a shove: every catch kills.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652525
    m_Localized: FAILING GRID
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652526
    m_Localized: Darker halls, dimmer lamps, further apart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652527
    m_Localized: SHORT FUSE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652528
    m_Localized: The escape countdown is a quarter shorter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652529
    m_Localized: IT HEARS EVERYTHING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652530
    m_Localized: 'Every floor carries the Keen Ears rule: the hunter hears far more.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652531
    m_Localized: THE DOORS DON'T HOLD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652532
    m_Localized: The asylum is breached on every visit to the hub after floor 4, not just once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652533
    m_Localized: STANDARD ISSUE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652534
    m_Localized: Nothing extra. Just the torch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652535
    m_Localized: SCAVENGER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652536
    m_Localized: Start with a Spare Battery and a Star Compass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652537
    m_Localized: RUNNER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652538
    m_Localized: Floor 1 starts with a Stamina Tonic and Quiet Shoes already working.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652539
    m_Localized: CARTOGRAPHER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652540
    m_Localized: Start with a Floor Plan.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
