    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652569
    m_Localized: WHAT IT HAS LEARNED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652570
    m_Localized: CHANGES TAKE EFFECT AT THE NEXT MAZE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1896792261652571
    m_Localized: TURNING ON ANY ASSIST MARKS THIS CAMPAIGN AS ASSISTED FOR GOOD.
